            "matched_surface": "train",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_e00c7fd8152534bcee32ef83",
            "source_text": "In deep learning, we *train* models, updating them successively\nso that they get better and better as they see more and more data.",
